                <pb facs="1789" n="1767" sameAs="frus:frus1950v05/pg1767"/>

                <head>Annex II</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Radio.</hi>
                </p>
                <p>A technical agreement between the American naval authorities and the competent
                    French naval authority will determine the modifications of the provisions of the
                    agreement of 15 September 1947 concerning the establishment and use of radio
                    facilities of the aero-naval base at Port Lyautey which the execution of the
                    works, the increase of air traffic or other causes might render necessary.</p>
            </div>
